tocked\",\"Disposed\"]}],\"description\":\"The bind 'Dispose Item: Return Status' links the 'Dispose Item' activity with the attribute 'Return Status', updating the status to 'Disposed' upon disposal.\"}],\"constraints\":[{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Request Return' activity must be the first activity to occur in the process, serving as the designated starting point of the product return workflow.\",\"template\":\"Init\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Request Return\",\"description\":\"The 'Request Return' activity represents the initiation of a product return by a customer, serving as the starting point of the return process workflow.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Request Return' activity occurs, then an 'Approve Return' activity must eventually occur after it at some point in the same process instance. The 'Approve Return' must occur within 24 hours of the 'Request Return'. There is no requirement on what events may occur in between. If 'Request Return' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Approve Return'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Request Return\",\"description\":\"The 'Request Return' activity represents the initiation of a product return by a customer, serving as the starting point of the return process workflow.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Approve Return\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Return' activity represents the system's approval of a return request, updating the Return Status to 'Approved'.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":\"0,24,h\",\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"The 'Generate Return Label' activity is permitted to occur only if an 'Approve Return' activity has occurred before it within the same process instance. The 'Generate Return Label' must occur within 30 